Package: jewbuntu-cutefish
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Jewbuntu Developers <maintainers@jewbuntu.invalid>
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Depends: cutefish-compositor, cutefish-core, jewbuntu-branding, python3, libglib2.0-bin
Recommends: shulgo-xfce
Homepage: https://jewbuntu.com
Description: Jewbuntu skin for Cutefish
 A light Jewbuntu skin over the Cutefish desktop (Debian 13, amd64 and arm64).
 Cutefish already looks like a Mac, so this only adds:
  - a Star of David as the dock's Launchpad ("start") button
  - the blue (light mode) and purple (dark mode) Star of David wallpapers
  - Jewbuntu's short startup jingle at sign-in (from jewbuntu-branding)
  - ShulGo's minyan widget in the top bar (recommended package shulgo-xfce)
